summary:
  An output menu left open in a window nobody is at runs its Bluetooth beat every five seconds.

history:
  The beat is a bluetoothctl pipeline. On a desktop face a menu left open
  slows it to fifteen seconds until the pointer comes back; the window is
  the other seat that never closes.

target:
  package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml

find:
                      interval: playerWindow.faceWatched ? 5000 : 15000

replace:
                      interval: root.planar && !root.faceHovered ? 15000 : 5000

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_level_is_asked_at_full_rate_only_while_somebody_is_at_the_face.
  Line-neutral.
